description: Locate ERP screens and calculations without full-repo search
alwaysApply: true
---

Before editing UI or business logic, read `docs/architecture/CODEMAP.md` and open only the listed paths.

- Account Master: `frontend/src/features/account-master/`
- Mandi calculations: `backend/anaj_erp/calculations/mandi.py`
- Menu/routing: `frontend/src/app/routing/`
- Legacy entry forms: `frontend/src/features/legacy/EntryWindowImpl.tsx` only when CODEMAP says so

Do not refactor unrelated modules in the same task.

## Rerun ERP

If the user asks to rerun/run/start the app, read [docs/cursor-rerun.md](docs/cursor-rerun.md) and run `tools/rerun_dev.ps1 -Agent` — do not explore the repo first.
